    turnFlow: '1. **Attack**: Play 1, 3, or 5 cards. 1 = any card. 3 = pair + third (e.g. 7-7-9). 5 = two pairs + fifth (e.g. K-K-4-4-7). 2. **Defend**: Beat each attack card with a higher same-suit card, or any trump on non-trump. Trump beats trump only with higher trump. 3. **Result**: Beat all â†’ defender attacks next. Unbeaten â†’ defender picks up those cards; attacker attacks again. 4. **Draw**: After each battle, both draw to 5 from stock (attacker first). 5. **Endgame**: When stock empty, no draws. Cannot attack with more cards than opponent holds. First to empty hand wins.',
